<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                        A quintessential masterpiece of Chettinad heritage, the Lotus Tile features a sophisticated radial geometry inspired by the sacred bloom. Each tile is individually handcrafted using time-honored techniques, ensuring a unique depth of color and a finish that develops a natural patina over decades.
                    </p>
