<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-surface-variant/80 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
                        Every YIREHMEX tile is a labor of patient precision. Following 19th-century Chettinad techniques, our artisans use locally sourced river sand, cement, and high-grade mineral oxides to create tiles that are not just flooring, but historical artifacts. 
